{"verses":[{"verse":1,"text":"Mpigieni \\nd Bwana\\nd* kelele za shangwe, dunia yote."},{"verse":2,"text":"Mwabuduni \\nd Bwana\\nd* kwa furaha;"},{"verse":3,"text":"Jueni kwamba \\nd Bwana\\nd* ndiye Mungu."},{"verse":4,"text":"Ingieni malangoni mwake kwa shukrani"},{"verse":5,"text":"Kwa maana \\nd Bwana\\nd* ni mwema"}]}